###Do This
1. If completing this activity digitally, open the digital Style Critique Activity Guide.
2. Add at least one strength and weakness for each page. 
3. Write one “mood” word that captures how the site feels (e.g., calm, fun, chaotic, etc). 

***Note: Refer back to the Usability Checklist in your Unit Guide if needed.***




